<h2>DeForest Buckner: Length and Burst</h2>
<div class="player-card">
<div class="player-name">DeForest Buckner</div>
<div class="player-sub">San Francisco 49ers · Defensive Tackle · 2016 Combine (Oregon), Pick 7</div>
<div class="player-stats">
<div class="player-stat">
<div class="player-stat-val">6'7"</div>
<div class="player-stat-label">Height</div>
</div>
<div class="player-stat">
