</div>
<h2>What's Next</h2>
<p>Seattle hosts Chicago on Monday Night Football, which could put Nelson on the same field as the Bears' new defensive tackle, <a href="/jeffery-simmons-bears-trade-athletic-profile">Jeffery Simmons</a>, and alongside Seattle receiver <a href="/jaxon-smith-njigba-1000-yards-eight-games-agility-profile">Jaxon Smith-Njigba</a> as he chases 1,000 yards in eight games. Buckner returns to a 49ers team leading the NFC West. For Indianapolis, the two deals bring back draft picks as a new front office starts a rebuild.</p>
